---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
// Text carried over unchanged from the current ironcladamc.com/privacy-policy.html.
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy of Ironclad Asset Management LLP.">
  <PageHero title="Privacy Policy." />
  <section class="section rule">
    <div class="wrap legal-text">
      <p>This website ironcladamc.com ("Website") is maintained and operated by Ironclad Asset Management LLP, having its registered office at Noida, Uttar Pradesh, India ("Ironclad AMC" and/or "We"). This Privacy Policy covers the information We collect from the user(s) ("User(s)" and/or "You") of the Website and/or the services on the Website ("Personal Information").</p>
      <h2>Privacy Principles</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Providing information to us is your choice.</li>
        <li>You can choose to have the Personal Information provided by You deleted.</li>
        <li>You always have the ability to opt-out of receiving communications from us.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Information Collection and Use</h2>
      <p>The Personal Information which You may provide to us and/or which We may collect is or could be the following:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your registration details which may include the password provided by You. We adopt reasonable security measures to protect Your password from being exposed or disclosed to any third parties.</li>
        <li>Your shipping, billing, tax registration, and other information pertaining to Your transactions on the Website.</li>
        <li>Your usage behaviour on the Website.</li>
        <li>Details of the computer system or computer network which You use to visit the Website and undertake any activity on the Website.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Information Sharing and Disclosure</h2>
      <p>Ironclad AMC may share your information with Platform Entities, joint ventures, agents, or third parties for services or marketing-related activities.</p>
      <h2>Compliance with Laws and Law Enforcement</h2>
      <p>We cooperate with government and law enforcement agencies to enforce and comply with the law.</p>
      <h2>Business Transfers</h2>
      <p>In the event of a merger, acquisition, or reorganization, your Personal Information may be transferred to the new entity.</p>
      <h2>Email Policies</h2>
      <p>You have full control over which emails you want to receive. Follow the unsubscribe instructions provided in the communications if you no longer wish to receive emails.</p>
      <h2>Deleting Your Information</h2>
      <p>If You wish to have the Personal Information that You have provided to us deleted, You can send a request to our Customer Services department.</p>
      <h2>Security</h2>
      <p>We use industry-standard technology to protect your Personal Information and prevent unauthorized access.</p>
      <h2>Links to Other Sites / Financial Data</h2>
      <p>We provide links to other websites for your convenience. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of linked websites.</p>
      <h2>Changes in Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Please visit this page periodically to review any changes.</p>
      <h2>Phishing</h2>
      <p>We will never request sensitive information in an insecure or unsolicited manner.</p>
      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, you can contact us via email at <a class="textlink" href="mailto:ir@ironcladamc.com">ir@ironcladamc.com</a>.</p>
      <h2>Grievances</h2>
      <p>If you have any grievances, please email us at <a class="textlink" href="mailto:ir@ironcladamc.com">ir@ironcladamc.com</a> with the subject "Grievance/Complaint".</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
